## 9. Testing and Acceptance Criteria

The template is complete only when:

1. All required Android and Gradle files are present.
2. GitHub Actions builds the debug APK successfully.
3. The APK can be downloaded and installed on an Android device.
4. A remote HTTPS website loads correctly.
5. Back navigation works correctly.
6. Network errors are handled appropriately.
7. Bundled mode uses a safe local-content loading approach.
8. Configuration instructions are tested.
9. Known limitations are documented.
10. The final review records actual test results.

## 10. Scope Limitations

A WebView wrapper does not automatically convert arbitrary desktop
applications into Android applications.

Bundling a website frontend does not automatically bundle its backend
or make the application fully functional offline.

Some websites require additional work for authentication, payments,
file handling, camera access, or other browser-dependent features.

Review the licence and permissions of every third-party project
before modifying, packaging, or distributing it.
